# ShedFX frontend configuration. Copy to .env (or .env.local) and edit.
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_ to the app.

# Base URL of the shedfx-backend API, no trailing slash.
# Local dev against the backend on the same machine:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
# On the Pi via Tailscale it will look like http://<pi-hostname>:8000
#
# NOTE: the backend does not currently send CORS headers, so a browser on
# the Vite dev origin (http://localhost:5173) cannot call port 8000 directly.
# Until CORSMiddleware is added to the backend, leave this EMPTY in dev and
# the app will use the Vite proxy in vite.config.ts (/api -> localhost:8000).
